From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IamMaxim <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 30 May 2026 21:51:10 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] strip: delete the orphaned Zed-cloud LLM request helpers
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

With edit prediction severed from the cloud, these helpers have no callers.
Delete them so a rebase that re-introduces cloud edit prediction fails to
compile:
- client::Client::authenticated_llm_request + cached_llm_token
- client::global_llm_token
- HttpClient::build_zed_llm_url

LlmApiToken, RefreshLlmTokenListener, and refresh_llm_token are kept — they
are still used by the agent and third-party LLM providers.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 crates/client/src/client.rs           | 66 ---------------------------
 crates/client/src/llm_token.rs        |  7 ---
 crates/http_client/src/http_client.rs | 16 -------
 3 files changed, 89 deletions(-)

